{"title":"Free English Classes  - in-person at our Toronto school ","startsAt":"2026-10-08T14:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-08T16:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Practise your English in a friendly, welcoming class in Toronto.\nJoin our free in-person English class and improve your speaking, fluency, grammar and vocabulary with supportive teachers. This class is a great opportunity to practise English, build confidence and meet new people.\n\n**When**\nEvery weekday Monday - Friday\n2.00pm–4.00pm\n\n**Where**\nTeaching House Toronto\nOHC / Sol Camps\n469 Jarvis St\nToronto, ON M4Y 2G8\nCanada\n\n[REGISTER NOW](https://4i4d9.share.hsforms.com/2GTDQYBIjRTmHonHUe_WuLQ)\n\n**What you’ll practise**\n\n* Speaking and fluency\n* Grammar and vocabulary\n* Listening and pronunciation\n* Everyday English for real-life situations\n* Confidence using English with other people\n\n**Who can join?**\nAdults aged 18+ who want to improve their English. Refugees, asylum seekers and newcomers are very welcome.\n\n**About the classes**\nThe classes are taught by trainee English teachers on a Cambridge-accredited CELTA course and supervised by experienced teacher trainers.\n\n**Cost**\nFree\n\n**Before the class**\nPlease arrive a little early so we can welcome you and check your English level.\nSpaces may be limited, so please RSVP if you would like to attend.Cost: FREE\n\nSign up using this [registration form ](https://4i4d9.share.hsforms.com/2GTDQYBIjRTmHonHUe_WuLQ)for automatic reminders and to be on our list for future classes.","venue":{"name":"Teaching House Toronto","address":"469 Jarvis St, Toronto","lat":43.66477,"lng":-79.37726,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"FREE English classes in Toronto, Canada","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/5/a/9/highres_534309641.jpeg"}